  dct:description "Forsvarsmateriell (FMA) intends to enter into a contract with SAP Norway AS on the following: Licences to upgrade the Defence sector ́s SAP system to S4/HANA including database. Maintenance of the procured system for up to five years. A time limited subscription for a cloud based reference system with software (sandpit)."@en;
  dct:title "Procurement of SAP licences"@en;
  adms:identifier <http://data.europa.eu/a4g/resource/266aa93b-ad5a-43bd-a271-17357063dfde-01/Identifier/LOT-0000> .

